===============================================================================
5. GAME DISTRIBUTION
===============================================================================

The original Yu-Gi-Oh! Forbidden Memories game is not distributed as part
of this project.

The provided patch is intended to contain only the modifications required
to transform a compatible copy of the original game into
Yu-Gi-Oh! Shin Forbidden Memories.

Users are responsible for providing their own legally obtained compatible
copy of the original game.


